      "feedback": "这里还是公共楼道，换个角落也不行。请收回自家。"
    },
    {
      "id": "case-to-fire-access",
      "source": "case",
      "mode": "drop",
      "target": "fire-access",
      "grants": [],
      "outcome": "neutral",
      "animation": "return-case",
      "feedback": "这里要留给消防设施使用，不能把杂物挪到这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "store-scooter",
      "source": "scooter",
      "mode": "drop",
      "target": "storage",
      "grants": [
        "scooter-stored"
      ],
      "outcome": "correct",
      "animation": "store-scooter",
      "feedback": "滑板车收好：消防设施前要保持可接近。"
    },
    {
      "id": "scooter-to-corner",
      "source": "scooter",
      "mode": "drop",
      "target": "corner",
      "grants": [],
